{"title":"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/accc80fdf164cef264f56a82b6f9f6add320fe05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /> that satisfies the equations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/b/1fb7cd17d0cd32dbf754496646ef8de10be4ce5f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x-y=1 \\qquad y-z=2 \\qquad xyz=77\\]\" width=\"287\" height=\"16\" />\nFind the value of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abb4651a76cb1e20a6011fbe27b95369f62f22aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x}{yz}+\\frac{y}{xz}+\\frac{z}{xy}-\\left( \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{y} + \\frac{1}{z}\\right) = \\dots\\]\" width=\"290\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding the equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/d/09de60f7648059000bf21b368a5ae9dd1b10e079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6dad1c49f23935151bc93e8ff40755ce5ef44907.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y-z=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" /> gives the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/7/7079578114e7e8bc1b7593c38e08fb17e94de00c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-z=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />.\nWe can rewrite the problem as:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19baccc11be3d6019143b57817b818185378c651.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x}{yz}+\\frac{y}{xz}+\\frac{z}{xy}-\\left( \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{y} + \\frac{1}{z} \\right) = \\frac{x^2+y^2+z^2-(yz+xz+xy)}{xyz}\\]\" width=\"508\" height=\"43\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/6/2765a2c7031c107729a7c10ee52d37d1c8b887db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)^2+(y-z)^2+(x-z)^2=2(x^2+y^2+z^2-(xy+xz+yz))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"519\" height=\"21\" /> and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/8/058c63cc3b7342535988d4c5f896eec9e78fed43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xyz=77$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"17\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5afeec1c037a276406bdd736573c621a10a4a83d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x^2+y^2+z^2-(xy+xz+yz)}{xyz}= \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{(x-y)^2+(y-z)^2+(x-z)^2}{77}\\]\" width=\"524\" height=\"43\" />\nAnd finally with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/d/09de60f7648059000bf21b368a5ae9dd1b10e079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6dad1c49f23935151bc93e8ff40755ce5ef44907.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y-z=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/7/7079578114e7e8bc1b7593c38e08fb17e94de00c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-z=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/e/7be2aeb47e6e224fba5f58f8820cde872072f7da.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{(x-y)^2+(y-z)^2+(x-z)^2}{77}=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1+4+9}{77}=\\boxed{\\frac{1}{11}}\\]\" width=\"446\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO\">2026 Indonesia District MO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems\">2026 Indonesia District MO</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_Distri